On October 26, 2025 at roughly 00:49, Anne Louise Ulmer was stopped by

Troopers Jeremy Miller and Dylan R. White (PSP Troop B) at Route 40 / N

Mount Vernon Ave, Uniontown — high beams on, straddling lanes, turning

